# Port of https://github.com/HakanSeven12/cadkernel at
# 953d546b68aef4b6692566a1a9b077fc5bd9fb4f, src/space/nurbs.rs.
#
# Constructors borrow inputs and allocate independent storage. Curve/surface
# values retain shared storage on ordinary copies and release it automatically.
# Their raw list fields are READ-ONLY borrowed views; never free or mutate them.
# A view remains valid while a copy of its owner is alive. The cad clone pattern
# deeply duplicates all lists, including surface rows. Geometric transformations
# allocate independent results; flag-only updates retain shared read-only lists.
# Invalid results have the same safe lifetime as valid ones.
# "free cad nurbs value" resets a caller variable, releasing its reference;
# other copies remain valid. Do not destroy managed locals manually.
# Returned tessellation lists are manually owned: free the list once.
#
# All coordinates, knots, weights and arithmetic are binary64. No degree cap is
# imposed. Source thresholds and evaluation order are retained, including the
# intentionally permissive constructor and distinct derivative weight scaling.
import lib/bim/nurbs3_storage.dl
import lib/bim/nurbs3_curve.dl
import lib/bim/nurbs3_surface.dl
